2026-07-27T07:51:21.9981086Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9981901Z i /tmp/Rtmp4p0hwC/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9982326Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9982834Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9983593Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9984658Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9985881Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:51:21.9986659Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
